---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>ERCOT Queue Detective</title>
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: #0a0f1e;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      .badge {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #38bdf8;
        border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.1;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e2e8f0 0%, #38bdf8 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 480px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }
      .stat {
        background: #111827;
        border: 1px solid #1e293b;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .stat-value {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #38bdf8;
      }
      .stat-label {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #64748b;
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
      }
      .source {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #334155;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .source a { color: #475569; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="badge">Live dashboard — launching today</div>
    <h1>ERCOT Queue Detective</h1>
    <p>
      Month-over-month tracking of every project in the ERCOT Generator
      Interconnection Status queue. Who's advancing, who slipped, and what's
      new this month.
    </p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-value">~30k</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Queue rows tracked</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-value">2018</div>
        <div class="stat-label">History back to</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-value">Monthly</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Refresh cadence</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="source">
      Data: <a href="https://www.ercot.com/gridinfo/resource" target="_blank">ERCOT GIS Report</a>
      &nbsp;·&nbsp; Public domain &nbsp;·&nbsp; Not affiliated with ERCOT
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
